The Black and White is a world separate from [[Færrin]] but connected to it through the [[Pharos]]. Past its black doorway stands a [[Geography/Black and White/Plaza|plaza]] of four buildings, one of them the way onward. [[Aut]] calls it Noire.

It is peopled by [[Bestiary/Shade|shades]] native to it. The dead of Færrin do not stay here; their souls pass through the Pharos and up to the [[Godhome]].
